{"ticker":"UBER","updated":"2026-10-24T00:23:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Uber Technologies, Inc.","shortName":"Uber Technologies, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.uber.com","fullTimeEmployees":36600,"marketCap":136238751744,"trailingPE":14.6271925,"forwardPE":15.115941,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4668868,"pegRatio":6.01,"targetMeanPrice":100.85522,"targetHighPrice":150.0,"targetLowPrice":70.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":46,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.122,"earningsGrowth":0.855,"grossMargins":0.40752,"operatingMargins":0.13317999,"profitMargins":0.17345,"totalRevenue":55226998784,"beta":1.265,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":100.35,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":65.41,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Uber Technologies, Inc. develops and operates proprietary technology applications in the United States, Canada, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. The company operates through three segments: Mobility, Delivery, and Freight. The Mobility segment connects consumers with a range of transportation modalities, such as ridesharing, carsharing, micromobility, rentals, public transit, taxis, and other modalities; and offers riders in a variety of vehicle types, as well as financial partnerships products and advertising services. The Delivery segment allows consumers to search for and discover restaurants to grocery, alcohol, convenience, and other retailers, as well as order a meal or other items, and either pick-up at the restaurant or have it delivered; and provides Uber direct, a white-label delivery-as-a-service for retailers and restaurants, as well as advertising services. The Freight segment manages transportation and logistics networks, which connects shippers and carriers in digital marketplace, including carriers upfronts, pricing, and shipment booking; and offers on-demand platform to automate logistics end-to-end transactions for small-and medium-sized businesses to global enterprises. Uber Technologies, Inc. has strategic partnership with Mews to embed ride booking, real-time tracking and integrated billing directly into the Mews platfor","summary_zh":"Uber Technologies, Inc. 在美國、加拿大、拉丁美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區開發和營運專有技術應用程式。該公司透過三個部門運作：行動部門、交付部門和貨運部門。移動出行領域將消費者與一系列交通方式聯繫起來，例如共乘、汽車共享、微型移動、租賃、公共交通、出租車和其他方式；並為乘客提供各種車輛類型，以及金融合作產品和廣告服務。送貨部分允許消費者搜尋和發現雜貨店、酒類、便利商店和其他零售商的餐廳，以及訂購餐點或其他物品，並在餐廳取貨或送貨；並提供 Uber direct（一種為零售商和餐館提供白標送貨即服務）以及廣告服務。貨運部門管理運輸和物流網路，連接數位市場中的托運人和承運人，包括承運人預付款、定價和貨運預訂；並提供按需平台，為中小型企業到全球企業實現物流端到端交易的自動化。 Uber Technologies, Inc. 與 Mews 建立策略合作夥伴關係，將乘車預訂、即時追蹤和整合計費直接嵌入到 Mews 平台中","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":95.66,"h":97.5,"l":95.125,"c":95.16,"v":10938100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":94.88,"h":96.82,"l":94.36,"c":96.53,"v":17163400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":96.5,"h":96.95,"l":95.33,"c":95.33,"v":11364300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":96.025,"h":96.11,"l":94.08,"c":95.96,"v":12024300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":95.995,"h":96.15,"l":91.61,"c":93.75,"v":19310000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":92.26,"h":93.537,"l":91.92,"c":92.81,"v":12883300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":92.75,"h":94.765,"l":92.18,"c":92.94,"v":12052200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":93.11,"h":93.125,"l":90.93,"c":91.98,"v":15960100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":92.53,"h":92.53,"l":88.84,"c":90.99,"v":20384500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":91.38,"h":94.56,"l":91.38,"c":94.36,"v":18906600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":94.5,"h":95.48,"l":92.77,"c":95.45,"v":11850200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":95.51,"h":96.1,"l":93.71,"c":94.21,"v":15944200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":94.55,"h":96.32,"l":94.0,"c":94.68,"v":16190100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":94.49,"h":96.27,"l":93.71,"c":95.89,"v":13659200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":95.8,"h":98.86,"l":95.52,"c":98.85,"v":18652400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":99.42,"h":99.7,"l":97.02,"c":97.83,"v":17257900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":96.07,"h":97.24,"l":92.12,"c":92.95,"v":44094000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":93.93,"h":95.05,"l":93.2